   {
    "title": "Floorkey",
    "description": "Rouge-like game focusing on dungeon crawling with puzzle-based game play from item-object interaction.\n\n• Implemented an algorithm to read in map data with the given colored crate function to cut down on 40+ lines of code that checked individual map cell’s color code.\n• ntegrated termion crate to retrieve user inputs byte-by-byte to create seamless interaction with the game.\n• Structured and managed the project to create cohesive interaction between codes.\nTechnologies: Rust, termion, colored",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Apr 2021 - Jun 2021"
   },
   {
    "title": "Forage Compass",
    "description": "Forage Compass stores the user’s location inputs into the database with specific tags and displays all the stored locations through the google-map.\n\n• Constructed front-end base with the hiding right and left menu and submenus for user interaction.\n• Assembled the connection between the google-map api and the front-end React to relay user location information and checked submenu items correctly via Hooks, such as context and states.\n• Integrated axios to fetch server data and post data to the server safely.\nTechnologies: React, Javascript, HTML, CSS, MongoDB, Express, Node.js, google-map-react",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Apr 2021 - Jun 2021"
   }
